    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre yo ng’ei tho pa Saul, kinde ma Daudi dwogo ku ba nek mi Juamaleki, man Daudi bedo ceng’ ario i Ziklag; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "etimbre i ceng’ mir adege, nia, nen, ng’atu acel uai ba Saul i kagonjo, ku kendi pare m’uyec, man ku ng’om i wie: man ebedo kumeno, kinde m’ebino ba Daudi, nia epodho i ng’om, man erwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi wacu ire kumae, Iai kani? man ewacu ire kumae, Aboth kud i ka ma Israel ugonjo i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi wacu ire kumae, Lembene timbre nenedi? Akwei, yer ira, Man eloko lembe kumae, Dhanu giringo ku dhu lwiny, man kind dhanu dupa bende podho e githo; man Saul ku Yonathan ma wode bende githo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Daudi wacu ni jalawobine m’uyero ire lembe kumae, Ing’eyo nenedi nia Saul ku Yonathan ma wode githo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.31.1+1SA.31.2+1SA.31.3+1SA.31.4+1SA.31.5+1SA.31.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 31:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.10.1+1CH.10.2+1CH.10.3+1CH.10.4+1CH.10.5+1CH.10.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kei 10:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jalawobine m’uyero ire uwacu kumae, Kan awok kum got Gilboa, nen, Saul ujeng’ kum tong’ pare; man, nen, magali ku weg riuni gilubo toke ma tek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kan eneno ng’eye, enena, man elwong’a. E aloko lembe kumae, Anuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ira kumae, In i ng’a? Man aloko ire lembe kumae, An a Jaamaleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ira kumae, Akwei, Cung i ng’eta, man inega; kum atem umaka; kum fodi kwo para ni bo i ia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno acungo i ng’ete, man anege, kum ang’eyo andha nia ecopo bedo kwo ngo yo ng’ei podho m’epodho man ating’o jamkermiwic ma ni i wie, ku gwang’ ma ni i bote, man akelogi keni ba rwoth para.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi lund umaku kendi pare, man eyeco; man dhanu ceke ma gini karacelo kude bende kumeca: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e can unegogi, man giywak, e giweko cam cil uthieno, pi Saul, man pi Yonathan ma wode, man pi dhanu pa Yehova, man pi ot mir Israel; kum gipodho ku palamularu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi wacu ni jalawobine m’uyero ire lembe kumae, In i dhanu ma kani? Man eloko lembe kumae, An a wod umondo, a Jaamaleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi wacu ire kumae, Lworo negi ngo nedi nirieyo cingi m’inyoth ko ng’atu ma Yehova wiro? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Daudi lwong’o ng’atu acel ma kind awobi, man ewacu kumae, Cor ceng’ni, man ipodh i wie. Man egoye, ketho etho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Daudi wacu ire kumae, Rimbi bed i wii; kum dhogi tuco lembe i wii, iwacu kumae, Anego ng’atu ma Yehova wiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
